cutor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"Both public task outcomes are satisfied with direct functional evidence. The mandatory restart protocol is complete: node1 had a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged the restart, changed boot identity from ac73b359-243e-418e-b7bb-a7cff423e597 to 992ab083-fd34-440b-90b4-53d72869e0c0, and recovered its services, listeners, valid configuration, and HTTP behavior. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the transition.","limitations":["Frontend behavior was tested from node1 using its managed IP rather than from an independent external client.","The fixed lifecycle listening-sockets observations were empty and therefore do not independently corroborate listener state; the executor's direct ss output supplies that evidence.","Three small final-response files remained under /tmp after evidence collection."]}
